{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29560","headline":"及第东归次灞上却寄同年 · 李商隐","name":"及第东归次灞上却寄同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳桂当年各一枝，行期未分压春期。\n江鱼朔雁长相忆，秦树嵩云自不知。\n下苑经过劳想像，东门送饯又差池。\n灞陵柳色无离恨，莫枉长条赠所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}